[[ ## user_request ## ]]
Give me an appropriate visualization for this dataset.

[[ ## data_schema ## ]]
JSON Schema (8 rows):
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "Aircraft": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Age": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "Passenger capacity": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "Mileage": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "Longest Flight time": {
      "type": "number"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "Age",
    "Aircraft",
    "Longest Flight time",
    "Mileage",
    "Passenger capacity"
  ]
}

Sample values:
  'Aircraft': ['AeroLynx A220', 'SkyBridge B737-900', 'Nimbus A321X', 'TitanAir B787-8', 'StratoCruise A350-900']
  'Age': [3, 9, 5, 7, 4]
  'Passenger capacity': [135, 178, 210, 242, 300]
  'Mileage': [420000, 2850000, 1600000, 3900000, 2100000]
  'Longest Flight time': [6.2, 7.1, 8.4, 15.6, 17.3]

Respond with the corresponding output fields, starting with the field `[[ ## reasoning ## ]]`, then `[[ ## vega_spec ## ]]`, and then ending with the marker for `[[ ## completed ## ]]`.
